,title,link,text,language,family
0,Khoe languages - Wikipedia,https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Khoe_languages,"The Khoe languages were once considered to be a branch of a Khoisan language family, and were known as Central Khoisan in that scenario. Though Khoisan is now rejected as a family, the name is retained as a term of convenience.",Naro,Khoe-Kwadi
