5,The EvoLex comparative dictionary of Khoe-Kwadi — Welcome,https://evolex.huma-num.fr/Khoe-Kwadi_home.html,"Figure 1: Historical distribution of Khoe-Kwadi language family in southern Africa. At present, Khoe-Kwadi languages are primarily spoken in Botswana and Namibia, but remnant speech communities also exist in Angola, Zimbabwe and South Africa (Figure 1).",Naro,Khoe-Kwadi
